<title>GREECE: KAPPA SECURITIES, N.DEVLETOGLOU ADMITTED FOR TRADE.</title>
<headline>KAPPA SECURITIES, N.DEVLETOGLOU ADMITTED FOR TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Athens stock exchange member firms Kappa Securities, N. Devletoglou Securities and Katsoulis Securities were admitted for trade, exchange sources told Reuters.</p>
<p>The benchmark index was down 0.85 percent at 912.98 on turnover of 103 million drachmas. More member brokers were being admitted continuously. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
